 supplier (place_order_vendor_b) if the primary keeps failing.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01HVG3LHhVgQCN8xHKKB5soR", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"category": "dock"}, "name": "search_catalog", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01XVtfcm1pbbuTtw5WiLvnpN", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"category": "monitor"}, "name": "search_catalog", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "DK-200 is in stock as new equipment, so DK-210 isn't needed. The order totals $1,554 (3 \u00d7 $189 + 3 \u00d7 $329), which is under the $2,500 approval threshold. Placing the order now.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01VgkMSvjz1bD5wNLcB4aXo6", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"lines": [{"sku": "DK-200", "qty": 3}, {"sku": "MN-27", "qty": 3}], "ship_to": "HQ", "idempotency_key": "newhire-dock-monitor-2024-HQ-DK200-MN27-x3"}, "name": "place_order", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The order request timed out. The idempotency key means a retry with the same key won't place a second order, so I'll retry with that key.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01Mbxti1wLr7hn435sCkWLB4", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"lines": [{"sku": "DK-200", "qty": 3}, {"sku": "MN-27", "qty": 3}], "ship_to": "HQ", "idempotency_key": "newhire-dock-monitor-2024-HQ-DK200-MN27-x3"}, "name": "place_order", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The retry reports a partial failure: the first line item may have committed and the order is incomplete. I'll check the order 